    "html": "<div class=\"c-hero o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__content\">\n<h1 class=\"c-hero__header\">Media centre</h1>\n<div class=\"o-border-small\"></div>\n<div class=\"o-flex\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__body\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__body-text\"><p>You can contact Sightsavers’ media team for information, interviews, quality photos, broadcast footage, case studies and statistics. </p>\n<p><strong>Office hours</strong><br/>\nMon-Fri, 9am-5pm<br/>\n+44 (0)1444 446 637<br/>\n<a class=\"pinklink\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#19696b7c6a6a596a707e716d6a786f7c6b6a37766b7e\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"77070512040437041e101f0304160112050459180510\">[email protected]</span></a></p>\n<p><strong>Out of hours</strong><br/>\nFor urgent media enquiries<br/>\n+44 (0)1444 225 843</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__navigation c-hero__navigation--desktop\">\n<button>\n    On this page\n    <svg class=\"c-hero__navigation-icon\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" id=\"Page-1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n<g fill=\"#921750\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\" id=\"#921750ff\" transform=\"translate(0.300000, 0.040000)\">\n<path d=\"M2.84,0.01 C7.09,4.24 11.32,8.49 15.56,12.73 C19.83,8.5 24.06,4.24 28.31,-7.10542736e-15 C29.26,0.94 30.21,1.88 31.15,2.83 C25.98,8.05 20.79,13.24 15.57,18.41 C10.37,13.22 5.17,8.04 0,2.83 C0.94,1.89 1.89,0.95 2.84,0.01 Z\" id=\"Path\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</button>\n<p>\n    On this page\n  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#key-media-contacts\">Key media contacts</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#latest-press-releases-\">Latest press releases </a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-wrapper\">\n<figure class=\"c-hero__media c-hero__media--image\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-bottom\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-caption-spacer\"></div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-top\">\n<div alt=\"Two members of the press stand behind video camera. In front of the camera, a woman is speaking.\" class=\"c-hero__media-image\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2409_Sightsavers-journalists-UN-mural-196649-1400x788.jpg')\"></div>\n</div>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__navigation c-hero__navigation--mobile\">\n<button>\n    On this page\n    <svg class=\"c-hero__navigation-icon\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" id=\"Page-1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n<g fill=\"#921750\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\" id=\"#921750ff\" transform=\"translate(0.300000, 0.040000)\">\n<path d=\"M2.84,0.01 C7.09,4.24 11.32,8.49 15.56,12.73 C19.83,8.5 24.06,4.24 28.31,-7.10542736e-15 C29.26,0.94 30.21,1.88 31.15,2.83 C25.98,8.05 20.79,13.24 15.57,18.41 C10.37,13.22 5.17,8.04 0,2.83 C0.94,1.89 1.89,0.95 2.84,0.01 Z\" id=\"Path\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</button>\n<p>\n    On this page\n  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#key-media-contacts\">Key media contacts</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#latest-press-releases-\">Latest press releases </a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
