    "html": "<div class=\"c-discover-more o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<h2 class=\"c-discover-more__title\">Latest press releases</h2>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more__grid\" data-columns=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-tease-card c-tease-card--\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__image\" href=\"/press-releases/2026/10/african-union-development-agency-and-sightsavers-join-forces-to-fight-neglected-diseases/\" target=\"_self\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Press-releases-thumbnail-580x326.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__content\">\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__taxonomy\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__tag\" href=\"/category/press-releases/\" target=\"_self\">Press releases</a> <span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"c-tease-card__header\">\n<a href=\"/press-releases/2026/10/african-union-development-agency-and-sightsavers-join-forces-to-fight-neglected-diseases/\" target=\"_self\">African Union Development Agency and Sightsavers join forces to fight neglected diseases</a>\n</h3>\n<p class=\"c-tease-card__preview\">The partnership will unite AUDA-NEPAD’s leadership and convening power with Sightsavers’ technical expertise in NTD elimination, disability inclusion and community-centred health programmes.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card c-tease-card--\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__image\" href=\"/press-releases/2026/10/global-leaders-urged-to-accelerate-investment-in-eye-care-to-generate-billions-in-economic-benefits/\" target=\"_self\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Press-releases-thumbnail-580x326.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__content\">\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__taxonomy\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__tag\" href=\"/category/press-releases/\" target=\"_self\">Press releases</a> <span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"c-tease-card__header\">\n<a href=\"/press-releases/2026/10/global-leaders-urged-to-accelerate-investment-in-eye-care-to-generate-billions-in-economic-benefits/\" target=\"_self\">Global leaders urged to accelerate investment in eye care to generate billions in economic benefits</a>\n</h3>\n<p class=\"c-tease-card__preview\">This World Sight Day (8 October), Sightsavers is calling on governments, donors, private and public sectors to integrate eye care into health systems, boost investment and service access.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card c-tease-card--\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__image\" href=\"/press-releases/2025/03/campaigners-urge-world-leaders-ahead-of-global-disability-summit-in-berlin/\" target=\"_self\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Press-releases-thumbnail-580x326.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__content\">\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__taxonomy\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__tag\" href=\"/category/press-releases/\" target=\"_self\">Press releases</a> <span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"c-tease-card__header\">\n<a href=\"/press-releases/2025/03/campaigners-urge-world-leaders-ahead-of-global-disability-summit-in-berlin/\" target=\"_self\">Turn promises into action, campaigners urge world leaders ahead of third global disability summit in Berlin</a>\n</h3>\n<p class=\"c-tease-card__preview\">The United Nations’ 2030 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) will not be met unless world leaders take concrete action on disability rights at a major summit this April, campaigners have warned.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card c-tease-card--\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__image\" href=\"/press-releases/2024/10/global-health-milestone-as-pakistan-eliminates-blinding-trachoma/\" target=\"_self\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Press-releases-thumbnail-580x326.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__content\">\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__taxonomy\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__tag\" href=\"/category/press-releases/\" target=\"_self\">Press releases</a> <span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"c-tease-card__header\">\n<a href=\"/press-releases/2024/10/global-health-milestone-as-pakistan-eliminates-blinding-trachoma/\" target=\"_self\">Global health milestone as Pakistan becomes 19th country to eliminate blinding trachoma</a>\n</h3>\n<p class=\"c-tease-card__preview\">Sightsavers commends Pakistan following the World Health Organization (WHO) announcement yesterday that it has become the nineteenth country to eliminate blinding trachoma as a public health problem.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card c-tease-card--\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__image\" href=\"/press-releases/2024/09/four-city-mural-campaign-challenges-world-leaders-on-disability-rights/\" target=\"_self\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Press-releases-thumbnail-580x326.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__content\">\n<div class=\"c-tease-card__taxonomy\">\n<a class=\"c-tease-card__tag\" href=\"/category/press-releases/\" target=\"_self\">Press releases</a> <span class=\"c-tease-card__tag-separator\">/</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"c-tease-card__header\">\n<a href=\"/press-releases/2024/09/four-city-mural-campaign-challenges-world-leaders-on-disability-rights/\" target=\"_self\">Art speaks louder: four-city mural campaign challenges world leaders on disability rights</a>\n</h3>\n<p class=\"c-tease-card__preview\">A series of murals have been unveiled in major cities around the world carrying a similar message: persons with disabilities must not be left behind in the fight to end global poverty.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
